GSys LibreCore (G6LC)
=====================

A RISC-V application-class processor core, derived from the OpenHW Group CVA6
(originally the PULP Platform "Ariane" core).

  Product name .... GSys LibreCore
  Short name ...... LibreCore
  Code prefix ..... G6LC
  Steward ......... GlobecSys Inc. ("GSys")
  Rights holder ... Etienne Cimon (LibreCore-original material)

